{
  "schema_version": "2.0",
  "id": "31568_kegasu",
  "headword": "{汚|けが}す",
  "reading": "けがす",
  "romaji": "kegasu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to disgrace; to defile",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to disgrace; to stain (a name or honor); to defile",
      "explanation": "To damage something that should be kept pure or respected, such as a family name, one's honor, or a sacred place."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31568_kegasu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{名誉|めいよ}→名誉：10568_meiyo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{汚|けが}す。",
      "english": "To stain one's honor.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31568_kegasu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{家名|かめい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{汚|けが}すようなこと⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧な。",
      "english": "Don't do anything that would disgrace the family name.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31568_kegasu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{不正|ふせい}→不正：01660_fusei⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦{長|なが}い→長い：00491_nagai⟧⟦{伝統|でんとう}→伝統：09585_dentou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{持|も}つ→持つ：00478_motsu⟧⟦{学校|がっこう}→学校：00055_gakkou⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{名|な}→名：03496_na⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{汚|けが}した。",
      "english": "His misconduct disgraced the name of a school with a long tradition.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive (takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{名誉|めいよ}→名誉：10568_meiyo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{汚|けが}す: to stain one's honor\n- ⟦{名|な}→名：03496_na⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{汚|けが}す: to disgrace a name\n- ⟦{神聖|しんせい}→神聖：13735_shinsei⟧な⟦{場所|ばしょ}→場所：00829_basho⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{汚|けが}す: to defile a sacred place\n\nWATCH OUT:\nThe same kanji is read よごす, {汚|よご}す, \"to make dirty\" in the physical sense. Honor, names and sacred things take けがす; mud and stains take よごす. Context decides the reading.",
